aset address reference key","UPRN is not the primary key for every AddressBase Premium table","record-specific primary keys must be preserved"]},{"source_id":"os_addressbase_csv_join_contract","authority":"Ordnance Survey","url":"https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/addresses-and-names-portfolio/addressbase-premium/addressbase-premium-getting-started-guide/working-with-csv-data","accuracy_score":100,"verified_facts":["BLPU joins to DPA, organisation and classification using UPRN","LPI joins to Street by USRN","record-type tables must be joined explicitly rather than flattened by row position"]},{"source_id":"os_places_dpa_lpi_dataset_boundary","authority":"Ordnance Survey","url":"https://docs.os.uk/os-apis/accessing-os-apis/os-places-api/datasets","accuracy_score":100,"verified_facts":["DPA is matched to Royal Mail PAF","not every property record has a DPA","LPI can exist without receiving Royal Mail deliveries"]},{"source_id":"os_addressbase_cou_processing","authority":"Ordnance Survey","url":"https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/addresses-and-names-portfolio/addressbase-premium/addressbase-premium-getting-started-guide/working-with-cou-data","accuracy_score":100,"verified_facts":["COU records use Insert, Update and Delete operations","PRO_ORDER preserves processing order","archived updated or deleted records may need an explicit derived archive end date kept distinct from source dates"]},{"source_id":"os_addressbase_epoch124_table_manifest","authority":"Ordnance Survey","url":"https://docs.os.uk/os-downloads/products/addresses-and-names-portfolio/addressbase-fundamentals/release-notes/addressbase-products-january-2026-epoch-124","accuracy_score":100,"verified_facts":["Epoch 124 MGBS counts include 30,960,300 DPA, 45,224,829 classification and 1,386,792 organisation records","successor record count is zero","MGBS and national AOI counts differ and supply type must remain explicit"]},{"source_id":"ofcom_fixed_coverage_field_contract_v2","authority":"Ofcom","